                "description": "Contemporary Security Door Guard with Ball Tension Action Deltana DGSB675 - Heavy duty, the ball tension lock is suitable for both commercial and residential applications. The contemporary design security door guard makes it perfect for modern homes and hotels. It is easy to install and operate. Made of solid brass, packaged with matching finish screws and available in 8 great finishes.",
